    "active_study": "study_ec3b5bef",
    "description": "Frame plate (grounded), four motor housings fixed to it and four rotor discs on revolute joints (alternating CCW / CW), velocity-driven up to the commanded speed. The rotor spin-up is a kinematic animation of the commanded rotation: it does not predict thrust or flight. Thrust coefficients are stored as prescribed inputs (not CFD).",
